Chat Edit: 'Update your imports
Replace all imports like this:

import { supabase } from '@/lib/supabaseClient';


with:

import { supabase } from '@/lib/supabase';


Affected files:

app/auth/login/page.tsx

app/auth/signup/page.tsx

app/auth/page.tsx

app/dashboard/components/Editor.tsx

app/dashboard/notes/NotesClient.tsx

Check tsconfig.json path alias

Make sure you have something like this:

{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "baseUrl": ".",
    "paths": {
      "@/*": ["./*"]
    }
  }
}


This allows @/lib/... to point to your project root.'
